{
    "info": {
        "name": "M41 - Reliability: Idempotency + Offline Sync + Conflicts",
        "description": "Canonical M41 collection. Covers the offline replay queue, idempotency inspection, sync job listing/retry, and replay-conflict resolution. Mirrors AI_POSTMAN_WORKING_PATTERNS R1-R20 patterns established by M39.x and M40.\n\nSee folder `00 Read Me` for variable flow, run order, and re-import warning.\n\nLocked rules verified here:\n- Replaying the same `clientMutationId` returns the same job (idempotent).\n- Retry on a SUCCEEDED job returns 409.\n- Conflict resolution transitions OPEN -> RESOLVED with audit.\n- Public diner mobile-money payment execution remains PENDING (no PAYMENT_CAPTURE replay handler is registered for the public diner path).",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
    },
    "variable": [
        {
            "key": "baseUrl",
            "value": "http://localhost:3001"
        },
